WEBVTT
# Subtitles for Star Catcher EP4

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.500
A comet with a body arrives.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Behind it, a hundred and ninety more.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.000
It has grown. It brought friends.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:46.500
The guardians dive from the perimeter. Painted sky, real teeth.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.000
The freed stars fight for their catcher.

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:41.000
The tiles of heaven flip away. An ocean of eyes staring down.

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:45.500
The sky was never above us.

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:48.500
It was just the other side of the water.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:15.500
The child lands upon the iron deck.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.000
Its chest opens.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:24.000
The star the catcher gave away so long ago comes home across the water.

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.200
Three hearts...

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.500
...finding the same beat.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:56.800
Every lantern breathing together across the calm world.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:01.500
The old rule was never 'don't look at the water.'

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.800
It was 'never look away.'

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.800
The pilot sleeps.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:24.500
The top is still spinning.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.500
Is it still spinning?
